mark draft

# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0019): a sketch with no native and no caller; a worker pool is its own item. It declared tasks that bound nothing, so a call built clean and
# threw `stub` at run time; out of the build until it has bodies.


form pool
  link dock, mark private
  link size, like size

task make
  take
    size
    like size
    need false
  like pool

task run
  mark async
  take pool, like pool
  take work, like task

task map
  mark async
  take pool, like pool
  take list, like list
  take work, like task
  like list

task close
  mark async
  take pool, like pool
